     "text": "… awareness. Issuing driving licences, patrolling roads and putting duty at crossings, maintaining traffic and law and order on roads, preventing accidents and reaching the scene of accidents is the responsibility of the police. Planning to solve traffic problems in cities and getting traffic laws respected is the duty of the police. To determine the legal status of vehicles it has its own scientific investigation centres. On every important road and crossing young police personnel stand ready for public service. If the police did not perform this responsibility, how many accidents would take place daily and how much illegal and criminal traffic would go on.",
