   "content": "<p>… complicated cases they take various scientific measures to find out the facts. Reaching the facts through fingerprints is an important scientific process. In this branch there are scientific laboratories in which, after the use of firearms, information is obtained by examining their pieces. Through scientific methods criminals and responsible persons are reached. The police, through its secret agents, assesses the situation before any incident, and enables the police to end crimes or accidents before they happen. The secret police is an important means of reaching the facts. This branch of the police also obtains information of a sensitive nature and in this way finds out the network of crimes. In this connection the role of volunteer citizens is very important.</p><p>2. Operational Branch:</p><p>Apart from investigative activities and the preparation of cases, all the remaining duties are the responsibility of this branch. It is also called the raiding branch.</p><p>Role of Army As a Government Institution</p><p>In our country the armed forces of Pakistan are a very important state institution. Legally the responsibility of protecting the country’s borders, and the duty of protection from internal and external attacks and aggression, has been entrusted to the army. The army’s most important responsibility is the protection of the country’s borders. In this connection the spirit and professional skill of the Pakistani army is hidden from no one. Like every country, Pakistanis have God-given abilities for development, but to bring them into use for collective interests and development, peace and protection from internal and external dangers are necessary. When the army, leaving other matters aside, pays attention to this responsibility of its own, a sense of protection arises among the people and they concentrate on creative activities. The army creates courageous, brave, trained and skilled manpower. The army, through its skilled force, builds roads, canals, bridges and tunnels etc. In the construction of the Karakoram Highway the army laid down lives …</p>",
