     "text": "1. The World Bank, the IMF and the GATT were established after the Second World War with the special interest of America. Its apparent aim was to support the economy of war-torn Europe, but politically America wanted to win the sympathy and cooperation of Europe and stop the spread of Soviet socialism.",
