   "content": "<p>Because of it the limit of investment has become very low.</p><p>Because of membership of the World Trade Organization, unemployment has increased.</p><p>Because of its membership poverty has further increased and the people’s standard of living has become further bad.</p><p>Social evils too have increased because of it. Social evils are indirectly its result.</p><p>Because of this agreement there has been a negative effect on the government’s income and expenditure.</p><p>The government and private sectors have been discouraged, and the role and partnership of these two sectors in national development has reduced.</p><p>Negative effects have been on agricultural and industrial development because we cannot compete with the goods and products of developed countries in the international market.</p><p>Because of the people’s interest in foreign goods the transfer of wealth abroad has taken place.</p><p>There has been a deficit in the balance of payments.</p><p>To support the falling financial system the burden of debt is increasing.</p><p>Because of it infrastructure has been ruined.</p><p>Because of economic deterioration political instability has arisen.</p><p>Because of it the country has become a victim of insecurity.</p><p>Immediately, Pakistan has been compelled to improve the quality of its products.</p><p>To control the negative effects of the world trade agreement Pakistan has had to give preference to SAARC, the Economic Cooperation Organization and free regional trade agreements, and is taking interest in regional trade activities. Attention is being given to the partnership of the private and government sectors. Work is going on to further increase special trade relations with China.</p>",
