   "content": "<p>… was targeted, but he escaped together with the aircraft.</p><p>At this time the most dangerous region of the world is the land of Palestine. The war between Israel and the Palestinians began in 1948 with the establishment of Israel. In this war both parties have had to face financial and human losses, and the land of Arabia is on the brink of a terrible destruction. The American president compelled both nations several times to hold talks, and important agreements took place under the leadership of the American president. For example, in 1993 the Oslo agreement, in which the Palestine Liberation Organization recognised Israel and Israel announced the establishment of the Palestinian National Authority in the Gaza Strip and some areas of the West Bank of the River Jordan. After this too the American presidents prepared both nations for talks. In this regard the American presidents Clinton, George Bush and Obama hold special importance. After the end of the First World War, the greatest role in the establishment of the League of Nations in 1920 was that of the then American president Wilson. He made a successful struggle, taking personal interest, to stop world destruction and establish a world institution.</p><p>From these few examples it is proved that in world conflicts the individual and personal role of individuals holds importance. Especially such leadership which has obtained world fame can play an effective role in the resolution of international problems.</p><p>Qualities of Negotiator/Mediator</p><p>In the arbitration of conflicts the role of the mediator is very important. Especially the importance of the mediator in partisan arbitration cannot be denied. Since this is an important work and not the work of every ordinary person, therefore several qualities in a mediator and negotiator are necessary. The important qualities of a mediator or negotiator are the following:</p><p>1. The mediator is like a judge; therefore the mediator should be impartial, sincere and honest. He should not lean towards any party. He should come forward with sincerity and personal good will and should display honesty very well.</p>",
