   "content": "<p>4. Match the columns:</p><p>5. Give short answers to the following questions:</p><p>1. Define a political party.</p><p>2. On what basis should the vote be given?</p><p>3. What is meant by military dictatorship?</p><p>4. Define a social movement.</p><p>5. State some kinds of social movements.</p><p>6. Write the answers of the following questions in detail:</p><p>1. State the role of political parties in the stability of democracy in Pakistan.</p><p>2. Review the government of any one political party in the light of its manifesto.</p><p>3. Write a detailed note on the structure and organisation of political parties.</p><p>4. Make clear the importance of social movements in making Pakistan an Islamic, democratic and welfare state.</p><p>5. State the factors which became the cause of the start of social movements.</p><p>6. Present proposals for the promotion of peace at the local level.</p><p>Practical activities:</p><p>1. Arrange a quiz on this chapter.</p><p>2. Hold a speech competition on the merits and demerits of political parties in Pakistan.</p><p>3. Making groups in the class, make charts containing the important points of the manifestos of different political parties.</p>",
