   "content": "<p>… come. Among them the most important is the achievement of national interests. Every country has its own interests. In international affairs everything can change, but bargaining is not done on national interests. Yes, changes are certainly made in national interests as needed. Middle Eastern oil is a very important national interest for America and other developed countries, and perhaps also one cause of wars in the region. Another cause of world conflicts is the ownership of territories. Behind the Pak-India wars an important motive is the region of Kashmir. The India-China war took place over the ownership of territory. The Iran-Iraq war took place over the ownership of the Shatt al-Arab area, and the cause of the long war between Palestine and Israel too is territory. International wars also take place over resources. The important cause of the Iraq-Kuwait war was oil. Similarly, from world accounts and commentaries it is estimated that in the Iraq and America war, besides other reasons, there was also the presence of oil there. An important reason for world wars is the establishment of the supremacy of big powers in small and weak countries. The exploitation of humans and countries too becomes the cause of wars. The most important cause of the Second World War was the inhuman and exploitative treatment done to Germany. Hitler, making it the basis, united the German nation. In the world the cause of most conflicts is difference in ideologies and the concept of supremacy. In the world the Cold War was fought between the Soviet Union and America from 1945–1990, which finally ended with the end of the Soviet Union. The arms race too becomes a cause of world wars.</p><p>Impacts of Conflicts and Wars at Local, National and International Level</p><p>Every war and conflict has far-reaching effects, whether this war is at the local, regional or world level. Below an outline is being presented:</p><p>Local impacts:</p><p>An important result of war appears in the form of an unstable society. A war-stricken society remains a victim of chaos and disorder. For some time there is unrest and the law-and-order situation is not good. The parties hate each other …</p>",
