   "content": "<p>… become. Within countries political changes in the form of leadership and changes in political systems take place. On the basis of insecurity new alliances are born and new economic organisations are formed.</p><p>Identification of Groups Affected by Conflicts and Wars at Local, National and International Level</p><p>All people somehow or other become targets of wars and conflicts, but some groups come especially under the influence of wars and conflicts. The identification of these groups is being done below:</p><p>Local groups:</p><p>Because of local wars social groups and relationships are affected. Relationships are affected most of all, especially at that time when the parties belong to one tribe or family. In local conflicts no one can easily adopt a moderate path. Therefore it is right to say that the social group is most affected by local conflicts. Children, the old, women and the disabled, i.e. the weak class or group, too are affected by local wars and conflicts. These people need care and support, but during or after wars doing so becomes difficult and this group is negatively affected. The business group too cannot remain without being affected. When at the local level people are engaged in war, their businesses and other business groups too face loss. A bright example of this is the unrest and suicide attacks and blasts in Karachi and the province of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa. These have had a very great effect on the business group and a marked decrease has occurred in buying and selling. When the basis of wars at the local level is religion and belief, minority religious groups are badly affected. The land is made narrow for them. Weak social classes and labouring people too face losses.</p>",
