     "text": "… many forms, for example the prejudice of capitalists with one another, or the prejudice of capitalists against the poor class. Office, social rank, cultural supremacy, superiority in knowledge and religion etc. are such things as can become the cause of prejudice. Solidarity is such a thing through which prejudice can be ended or reduced.",
