   "theory": "Exercise\n\n1. Fill in the blanks in the following sentences with suitable words:\n\n1. Where there is ________ , there are no violence and hatreds.\n\n2. In the charter of the United Nations the right of ________ has been recognised.\n\n3. In Pakistan there is a need for an autonomous and independent ________ .\n\n4. Islam teaches human ________ .\n\n2. Mark the correct sentences as “correct” and the wrong sentences as “wrong” in the following:\n\n1. A peaceful society is a society moving on the path of development. (correct / wrong)\n\n2. In developing and backward societies the rate of education is adequate. (correct / wrong)\n\n3. The events after wars do not affect foreign policies. (correct / wrong)\n\n4. In Pakistan there is no religious extremism. (correct / wrong)",
