   "theory": "About the Author\n\nProfessor Bakhtiar\n\nThe author of this book, Professor Bakhtiar, belongs to Swabi. He obtained first position in M.A. Political Science from the University of Peshawar. From the same university, as a private candidate, he obtained the degree of M.A. History. Today he is the head of the Department of Political Science at the Government Post Graduate College Swabi.\n\nThe author has written several books for the Textbook Board. He has also written several books on political science, international relations, civics, ethics and history etc.",
